{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stretcher Together</strong> is a cooperative 3D platformer for two players where you take on the roles of medics rescuing a patient after a bad fall. Together with your partner, you must climb upward through a massive vertical platforming level. Jump, balance, and scramble your way up\u2014but don\u2019t drop the patient, or you\u2019ll have to go back for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883760/extras/5145bb90d2b48e17ba6ec2577d1ce803.poster.avif?t=1753194783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883760/extras/5145bb90d2b48e17ba6ec2577d1ce803.webm?t=1753194783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883760/extras/5145bb90d2b48e17ba6ec2577d1ce803.mp4?t=1753194783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2-player cooperative mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The patient can fall if players act carelessly.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The stretcher ties the characters together \u2014 you can pull or push each other.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A huge vertical map with moving platforms, traps, and puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883760/extras/db2c6773c183f48638b3e4606c4312c9.poster.avif?t=1753194783\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883760/extras/db2c6773c183f48638b3e4606c4312c9.webm?t=1753194783\" type=\"video/webm;